{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30258","headline":"伏闻令公疾愈对见延英因有贺诗远封投献 · 薛逢","name":"伏闻令公疾愈对见延英因有贺诗远封投献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吉语云云海外传，令公疾愈起朝天。\n皇风再扇寰区内，人镜重开日月边。\n光啓四门通寿域，深疏万顷溉情田。\n陪臣自讶迷津久，愿识方舟济巨川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}